    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n63764" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λογοποι-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>write, compose</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				378d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Lg.</u>
				636d
			</span></i>; <i>write speeches</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Euthd.</u>
				289d
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>fabricate tales</i>, esp. of newsmongers, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				6.38
			</span></i>, 
			<i><span class="en">
