				1.54
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				16.11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				4.49
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Char.</u>
				8.1
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς [συμφορὰς] αὐτοὶ λογοποιοῦσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lys.
					22.14
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λ. κατὰ τῆς πόλεως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					28.2.4
				</span></i>
			:—
